 "segments": [
  {
   "id": "hook1",
   "text": "Morning drive over the river. Coffee in the cup holder. Then your coffee floats out of the sunroof.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "id": "hook2",
   "text": "Gravity just switched off. The whole bridge is floating. And so are you. What do you do?",
   "gap": 0.9
  },
  {
   "id": "wrong1",
   "text": "Most drivers think: full throttle! Get off this bridge!",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "id": "wrong2",
   "text": "Big mistake. Your wheels spin in thin air. And your car does a backflip. And another one.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "id": "wrong3",
   "text": "You tumble higher and higher. Then gravity comes back. And you land on top of the bridge tower. Like a cat up a tree.",
   "gap": 0.9
  },
  {
   "id": "wrong4",
   "text": "Exam failed.",
   "gap": 1.15
  },
  {
   "id": "right1",
   "text": "Here's how you do it properly.",
   "gap": 0.3
  },
  {
   "id": "right2",
   "text": "Stay calm. Hazard lights on. Open the sunroof. And put up your umbrella.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "id": "right3",
   "text": "A little breeze catches it, and carries you gently over the river. Like a balloon.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "id": "right4",
   "text": "Two seagulls fly along with you. They have never seen a flying car.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "id": "right5",
   "text": "At the other end, gravity comes back. And you land softly, right in your lane.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "id": "right6",
   "text": "And your coffee drops back into the cup holder. Not a single drop spilled.",
   "gap": 0.6
  },
  {
   "id": "right7",
   "text": "Exam passed.",
   "gap": 1.3
  },
  {
   "id": "outro",
   "text": "Next exam question: your sat-nav says turn left. But left is a runway. Follow, so you don't miss it.",
   "gap": 1.2
  }
 ],
